    <briefdescription>
<para>Class to conveniently track Seeds within SeedBundles. </para>
    </briefdescription>
    <detaileddescription>
<para>Saves newly collected seeds in the proper bundle. Supports constant-time removal, as seeds and entire bundles are vectorized and marked used to signify removal. Iterators skip bundles that are completely used. </para>
